OL,3,GNEWSABody still missing after four
OL,4,Aconvictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Whyley, 37, and Thomas Young, 30,
OL,7,Fwere convicted on Tuesday of kidnapping
OL,8,FRobbins, while Junior Makosso, 29, was
OL,9,Ffound guilty of perverting the course
OL,10,Fof justice and Sam Jones, 27, had
OL,11,Fearlier pleaded guilty to kidnap and
OL,12,Ffalse imprisonment.
